        – Can you observe what’s happening on the ground? <br />
        – Can you learn tools fast?<br />
        – Can you talk to farmers, workers, clients, teams?<br />
        – Can you think practically, not just theoretically? 
    </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">These are <b>real-world skills,</b> not exam skills.</p>
    <p class="paraCommon">And here’s the twist:</p>
    <p class="paraCommon">Most people already have some of these skills - they just never realised they count.</p>
    <p class="paraCommon">Green education is mostly about <b>connecting what you already know with what the planet needs.</b></p>

    <p class="paraCommon"></p>
